lly playful around guys but please lessen it. It'll just fuel the overthinking and insecurities of your other half. Your ex and I are examples. I hope you realize how much it hurts us seeing you happy with another guy while you look at us with no excitement at all. The thing is, almost every male you entertain will come to think that they have a chance because you're showing them the attention that they want, and once they see an opportunity, they will grab it. Even though you don't have any intention with them, your significant other will look pathetic. But you have already promised to me na regarding with this one, so I’m expecting it. You know how you felt when you heard that your man follows and likes other pictures or videos of women on the internet. It feels just like that. So before you act, I want you to think if someone did that to you, will it be okay to you? If not then don't do it. ", image: null },
  
  
